      "title": "National Council of Teachers of Mathematics",
      "abstract": "Organized groups of teachers of mathematics or of individuals preparing to become teachers of mathematics may petition the NCTM Board of Directors to become affiliated with the Council. Affiliated Groups are entitled to send a delegate to the delegate Assembly, which is held each year in conjunction with the NCTM Annual Meeting. The Assembly is a highly respected and influential recommending body of the Council that discusses and votes on resolutions concerning matters pertinent to mathematics education.",
